, in the order that spends the least on a bad response:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A non-2xx status throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLError.badServerResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", with the status","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in its description, ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before the body is read at all"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — an error","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"page is not a config, however well it decodes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A declared ","type":"text"},{"code":"Content-Length","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" above the cap throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLError.dataLengthExceedsMaximum","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" immediately, without transferring","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the body.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Otherwise bytes accumulate and the transfer is abandoned as soon as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the count exceeds ","type":"text"},{"code":"limit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so the process never holds more than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cap plus one chunk.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The deadline covers the whole exchange, headers and body together."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLRequest.timeoutInterval"},{"type":"text","text":" can’t do that job: it is an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"idle","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" timeout,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reset by every packet, so a response that trickles in a byte at a time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"never trips it, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLSession.shared"},